1
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:18,123
Hi, we are here in Shinjuku, Tokyo.

2
00:00:18,123 --> 00:00:22,831
Today, we're going to visit a cat cafe🐈💓

3
00:00:27,146 --> 00:00:33,394
The cat cafe we're visiting today is just a 2-minute walk from Shinjuku Station.

4
00:00:33,394 --> 00:00:37,500
We'll head down Shinjuku Central Street.

5
00:00:38,759 --> 00:00:46,828
It's on the 6th floor of that building. The location is a bit tricky to find, so be careful⚠️

6
00:00:47,332 --> 00:00:54,242
It's 3 p.m. now. We plan to have plenty of fun at the cat cafe until the evening.

7
00:00:54,242 --> 00:01:02,241
This time, We'll also show you a little bit of what the cats are like when the cafe closes☺️

8
00:01:02,755 --> 00:01:07,700
This is the front desk.

9
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:12,491
You check in with a tablet.

10
00:01:12,491 --> 00:01:17,699
You can choose from Japanese, English, Chinese, or Korean.

11
00:01:17,699 --> 00:01:24,745
You pay when you leave, the machine will calculate your total based on how long you stayed.

12
00:01:24,745 --> 00:01:28,544
This is the slipper machine.

13
00:01:29,316 --> 00:01:33,542
&gt;&gt; Staff: Please change into slippers.

14
00:01:33,542 --> 00:01:38,529
&gt;&gt; Staff: There are lockers in the back. Please leave your shoes and belongings there.

15
00:01:43,112 --> 00:01:47,487
The locker room is quite spacious.

16
00:01:47,487 --> 00:01:54,000
If you have large luggage like suitcases, you can leave them at the front desk.

17
00:01:56,069 --> 00:02:01,817
Once you've chosen a locker and put your belongings in, lock it🔑

18
00:02:01,817 --> 00:02:12,067
On the key, there are rules written like "Please do not use flash photography". Let's make sure to check them.

19
00:02:12,067 --> 00:02:20,066
There are clean washrooms and two restrooms near the locker room.

20
00:02:20,534 --> 00:02:26,065
Drinks are all you can drink.

21
00:02:26,065 --> 00:02:32,106
They have a wide variety of drinks like juice, cocoa, coffee, and more🥤✨

22
00:02:32,106 --> 00:02:35,439
"The recommendation this month is Maple Tea"

23
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:43,396
Remember to put a lid on your cup so it doesn't get knocked over by a cat.

24
00:02:43,828 --> 00:02:51,645
These are the cats that are here. They're all too cute.

25
00:02:51,645 --> 00:02:55,145
Let's go meet them.

26
00:02:57,087 --> 00:03:02,182
The cat space has a door.

27
00:03:04,042 --> 00:03:09,003
It has a stylish atmosphere, doesn't it?

28
00:03:11,013 --> 00:03:19,017
Cat Cafe Mocha is a chain store with branches all over the country, but the Shinjuku branch is one of the largest.

29
00:03:21,057 --> 00:03:26,016
Please note that this branch is only for guests 13 years and older.

30
00:03:26,016 --> 00:03:34,973
It's spacious yet intricate design allows you to enjoy your time without worrying about other guests.

31
00:03:41,145 --> 00:03:48,138
Weekday rates are 220 yen (1.58 USD / € 1.47) for every 10 minutes. The maximum charge is 2,640 yen (19.00 USD / € 17.65).

32
00:03:48,138 --> 00:03:53,137
There's an additional charge of 385 yen (2.77 USD / € 2.57) for the drinks.

33
00:03:53,644 --> 00:04:00,643
If you stay for more than 2 hours, the maximum charge is applied automatically.

34
00:04:06,927 --> 00:04:11,760
Oops, sorry😭 I surprised you there.

35
00:04:11,793 --> 00:04:21,175
They have a wide variety of manga! They even have the latest titles.

36
00:04:21,931 --> 00:04:25,841
In the back, there's a space with larger tables and sofas.

37
00:04:26,879 --> 00:04:33,174
The cafe is very clean, and there's no smell at all.

38
00:04:38,610 --> 00:04:41,869
Hello there.

39
00:04:49,074 --> 00:04:54,879
There are beds where you can lie down with cats, your partner, or your friends.

40
00:04:55,511 --> 00:05:00,878
The staff are always taking care of the cats and cleaning the room.

41
00:05:01,813 --> 00:05:06,559
This is Kinu-Kun, getting his nails clipped.

42
00:05:07,628 --> 00:05:13,227
He's looking pretty unhappy (Ｕ˘•_•˘Ｕ) I'm sorry but so cute. haha

43
00:05:13,710 --> 00:05:18,744
Good job for being so calm.

44
00:05:19,752 --> 00:05:28,708
There are small doors leading to the staff room scattered about, and you can see the cats going in and out every now and then👀

45
00:05:29,428 --> 00:05:34,428
That's where the the cat's litter boxes are.

46
00:05:45,785 --> 00:05:50,747
There are water stations in the cafe space.

47
00:05:51,691 --> 00:05:58,996
After the cats' breakfast time, there's apparently a line for this water station.

48
00:06:03,784 --> 00:06:09,994
Many cats are curious about the camera and often come closer on their own.

49
00:06:11,098 --> 00:06:15,744
Blanc-Kun is very interested.

50
00:06:17,793 --> 00:06:23,743
You are allowed to touch the cats at the cafe. Gently pet them☺️

51
00:06:28,724 --> 00:06:34,700
The cats are cute and unique, and they're very healing haha

52
00:06:41,324 --> 00:06:48,739
There's a lot of facilities, so there are many people who come here alone or use it for work or study.

53
00:06:48,739 --> 00:06:55,614
They lend out chargers and have outlets and free Wi-Fi.

54
00:06:55,614 --> 00:06:59,613
There are blankets available too.

55
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:11,945
You can try the crane game for free twice per person.

56
00:07:11,945 --> 00:07:14,884
Let's give it a shot.

57
00:07:27,409 --> 00:07:30,251
Oh, I did it!

58
00:07:31,655 --> 00:07:38,551
Remember, the snacks inside the capsules are for humans, not cats.

59
00:07:40,242 --> 00:07:43,982
I got Cuppy Ramune.

60
00:07:43,982 --> 00:07:49,010
Here is the capsule toy for cat snacks.

61
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:53,635
Laki-Kun is staring at us.

62
00:08:03,119 --> 00:08:06,396
Wow, I got a cat punch!

63
00:08:07,878 --> 00:08:09,878
Hey, hey 😂

64
00:08:10,811 --> 00:08:15,770
Petite snack: 100 yen (0.72 USD / € 0.67)

65
00:08:15,770 --> 00:08:23,853
Be careful, as only 100 yen coins can be used. Make sure to bring cash!

66
00:08:26,832 --> 00:08:30,919
Hmm? I feel a gaze...

67
00:08:33,752 --> 00:08:42,142
In addition to these snacks, they also sell cat ice cream, cat manma, and cat cocktails for 550 yen (3.96 USD / € 3.67).

68
00:08:43,221 --> 00:08:52,584
There's also a "Nyan Nyan Set" for 1,100 yen (7.91 USD / € 7.35) where you can take a picture holding a cat of your choice and cat ice cream.

69
00:08:52,584 --> 00:08:57,231
The set is only sold at the Shinjuku store🐈

70
00:08:59,292 --> 00:09:06,263
It gets busy around 3 to 6 pm, so there are some cats who aren't hungry.

71
00:09:08,305 --> 00:09:13,505
Any cats want a snack?

72
00:09:15,335 --> 00:09:19,678
Anzu-Chan came over🥺

73
00:09:22,653 --> 00:09:28,323
Ume-Chan came too. Do you want to eat?

74
00:09:31,225 --> 00:09:33,225
Here you go.

75
00:09:35,235 --> 00:09:38,218
You don't want it?!

76
00:09:44,272 --> 00:09:47,259
Is it good?☺️

77
00:09:52,494 --> 00:10:00,256
Ume-Chan keeps coming over to tease.

78
00:10:05,210 --> 00:10:09,172
What's with that sitting position?😂

79
00:10:09,172 --> 00:10:14,434
It's amusing and cute with lots of charm.

80
00:10:15,370 --> 00:10:19,357
Do you want to eat too, Komachi-Chan?

81
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:27,795
Your round and sparkling eyes are so cute.

82
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:36,502
Oh, she ate it.

83
00:10:39,001 --> 00:10:46,709
At first, you seemed a bit surprised, but I think you're already friends with the camera.

84
00:10:50,094 --> 00:10:52,850
So fluffy

85
00:10:54,838 --> 00:10:59,790
ASMR cat chewing near the microphone.

86
00:11:05,925 --> 00:11:12,747
To get along with the cats, treats are a must.

87
00:11:12,747 --> 00:11:18,353
When you go to a cat cafe, be sure to give them some snacks☺️

88
00:11:20,393 --> 00:11:26,370
A space where you can stretch out and relax.

89
00:11:26,370 --> 00:11:32,196
The floor is Japanese tatami, so you take off your slippers.

90
00:11:37,973 --> 00:11:41,952
Thanks for showing us around.

91
00:11:46,585 --> 00:11:53,284
Here you can enjoy card games and board games for free. There's a lot of variety!

92
00:11:54,931 --> 00:12:01,907
The fact that humans can also enjoy their own time freely is a charm of MOCHA.

93
00:12:03,771 --> 00:12:08,732
Let's try out the TV game space.

94
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:14,802
We played Super Smash Bros on the Nintendo Switch.

95
00:12:14,802 --> 00:12:18,144
Have you ever played it?

96
00:12:19,152 --> 00:12:24,121
There are also toys for the cats.

97
00:12:28,719 --> 00:12:33,028
I wonder if anyone will come over😚

98
00:12:35,164 --> 00:12:41,361
Wow, an unexpected Ninja Stella-Chan came from somewhere.

99
00:12:48,901 --> 00:12:54,901
Haru-Chan is a kitten born in October 2022.

100
00:12:55,738 --> 00:13:04,639
Depending on the mood of the cat, kittens are more likely to play with you than adult cats.

101
00:13:05,648 --> 00:13:13,394
The Shinjuku branch has quite a few kittens. They're tiny, curious, and super cute.

102
00:13:14,523 --> 00:13:19,897
Anzu-Chan in sleepy mode.

103
00:13:19,897 --> 00:13:25,908
She's taken over the borrowed charger case completely.

104
00:13:31,431 --> 00:13:36,395
Oh, Kurage-Chan spotted the camera.

105
00:13:38,227 --> 00:13:43,681
She's a girl born in October 2022. She's very curious.

106
00:13:46,831 --> 00:13:49,810
She bit it! haha

107
00:13:49,810 --> 00:13:53,225
It's cute, so you can forgive anything.

108
00:13:53,878 --> 00:13:58,851
Cat ice cream: 550 yen (3.96 USD / € 3.67)

109
00:14:01,108 --> 00:14:04,727
Komachi-Chan, want some?

110
00:14:06,544 --> 00:14:11,099
You don't want it?

111
00:14:14,474 --> 00:14:19,015
You don't seem to be in the mood either.

112
00:14:20,041 --> 00:14:25,014
Tamae-Chan ate it.

113
00:14:25,014 --> 00:14:30,139
She's adorable eating earnestly with a stern face.

114
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:38,599
So cute that we are smitten🐱

115
00:14:44,167 --> 00:14:49,293
How about Soboro-Chan?

116
00:14:50,069 --> 00:14:56,052
This cat ice cream is a type of liquid cat treat that has been frozen.

117
00:14:56,052 --> 00:15:02,801
I wonder if they're not cold? But once they start eating, everyone gets hooked😂

118
00:15:05,759 --> 00:15:10,550
She really eat it deliciously.

119
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:15,674
Somehow it's cute like a tiger.

120
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:21,880
💓

121
00:15:28,929 --> 00:15:34,172
She's tilting her head a lot. LOL, so cute🤭

122
00:15:35,709 --> 00:15:38,901
It was good, wasn't it?

123
00:15:39,541 --> 00:15:45,082
Thank you for eating all of it.

124
00:15:46,629 --> 00:15:49,647
Now, let's get some work done.

125
00:16:01,550 --> 00:16:08,167
The Wi-Fi download speed is 230Mbps. It's fast and comfortable.

126
00:16:15,101 --> 00:16:19,333
What's up, Stella-Chan?

127
00:16:21,416 --> 00:16:27,332
Being cheered on by cats while working or studying is too blissful.

128
00:16:27,332 --> 00:16:34,706
Especially this table has lots of outlets, so you can work for a long time.

129
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:43,996
Drinks are also all-you-can-drink, so it seems like it would be more productive than going to a regular cafe. haha

130
00:16:54,399 --> 00:17:00,824
That's your favorite place. Thanks for being with us.

131
00:17:04,597 --> 00:17:08,576
A staff member came over.

132
00:17:09,576 --> 00:17:16,151
When a staff member comes, all the cats suddenly become very affectionate, which is very cute🥺

133
00:17:18,218 --> 00:17:24,741
Stella-Chan can do tricks! We were taught how to do it.

134
00:17:27,736 --> 00:17:32,865
Amazing! How cute!!

135
00:17:40,478 --> 00:17:43,332
&gt;&gt; Staff: Good girl.

136
00:17:44,613 --> 00:17:48,613
Will she do it for me too?

137
00:17:49,664 --> 00:17:53,279
Ah, she ate the snack. Failure.

138
00:18:03,077 --> 00:18:08,956
Wow, what a gentle and good girl. Thank you, Stella-Chan.

139
00:18:12,006 --> 00:18:20,275
Normally you pay afterwards, but you can pay the maximum fee in advance and go out in between.

140
00:18:20,275 --> 00:18:25,275
Let's go eat dinner.

141
00:18:26,390 --> 00:18:32,565
Since it's Shinjuku, there are plenty of restaurants, but today we feel like ramen🍜

142
00:18:33,393 --> 00:18:39,309
We came to Yokohama-style ramen shop, just a minute walk from the cat cafe.

143
00:18:45,544 --> 00:18:51,521
Yokohama-style ramen, salt, large: 1,000 yen (7.19 USD / € 6.68)

144
00:18:51,521 --> 00:18:57,521
Yokohama-style ramen, soy sauce: 880 yen (6.33 USD / € 5.88)

145
00:18:58,294 --> 00:19:02,270
I love ramen.

146
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:09,260
The noodles were thick and rich, and it was delicious! Thank you for the meal.

147
00:19:10,297 --> 00:19:14,727
We are back

148
00:19:25,042 --> 00:19:30,016
Here comes the fluffy one.

149
00:19:36,501 --> 00:19:42,473
After 7 PM, the number of customers in the cafe started to decrease.

150
00:19:44,364 --> 00:19:50,055
Relaxed mode Ram-Chan. She's chubby and cute.

151
00:19:51,364 --> 00:19:56,888
From 7:30 PM, it's dinner time for the cats.

152
00:19:56,888 --> 00:20:03,512
As feeding time approaches, the cats start to get restless and seem to become more active than in the afternoon💭

153
00:20:12,509 --> 00:20:18,427
It's interesting and cute just watching the communication between the cats🤣

154
00:20:29,933 --> 00:20:33,842
The chubby flesh around his neck is cute.

155
00:20:47,974 --> 00:20:51,589
Thanks for the service shot.

156
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:57,672
Now it's almost dinner time for the cats. They're all gathered because they're hungry.

157
00:21:00,996 --> 00:21:07,834
At MOCHA, there are two feeding times for the cats, at 10:30 am and 7:30 pm.

158
00:21:07,834 --> 00:21:14,668
It's recommended to visit at this time to see their very cute appearance.

159
00:21:20,986 --> 00:21:25,937
Oh, it seems like dinner time is about to start.

160
00:21:31,106 --> 00:21:35,709
&gt;&gt; Staff: We will now start the cats' dinner time.

161
00:21:35,853 --> 00:21:41,846
&gt;&gt; Staff: The cats eat in a line on the round stage, so please watch from the other side.

162
00:21:47,799 --> 00:21:52,915
Everyone's tail wagging is cute.

163
00:22:02,273 --> 00:22:05,029
&gt;&gt; Staff: Now, let's start lining up the cat's meals.

164
00:22:29,096 --> 00:22:33,435
This is indeed a spectacular view.

165
00:22:35,483 --> 00:22:40,450
The sight of them lined up and eating eagerly is really cute.

166
00:23:31,514 --> 00:23:37,360
The cats who have finished eating are leaving.

167
00:23:46,069 --> 00:23:51,048
Who's the biggest foodie today?

168
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:34,269
When the staff holds it, I wonder if it looks delicious.

169
00:24:41,781 --> 00:24:47,010
The turnover of the finalists is intense.

170
00:24:47,010 --> 00:24:52,017
I'm starting to lose track of who will win.

171
00:24:57,112 --> 00:25:00,765
&gt;&gt; Staff: That's it for dinner time. Thank you very much.

172
00:25:14,474 --> 00:25:23,096
The winner is Ram? Raisin? They're twins, so I don't know which one!😂

173
00:25:25,152 --> 00:25:32,095
The closing time is 8 PM. Today we are going to show you what it's like at closing time.

174
00:25:32,135 --> 00:25:37,094
After closing, the cats also go home.

175
00:25:37,239 --> 00:25:41,510
&gt;&gt; Staff: Please take a close-up. This is Daiya-Kun.

176
00:25:46,022 --> 00:25:52,700
There are many cats who don't want to go home, and this is actually the most hard job.

177
00:25:54,001 --> 00:25:56,937
&gt;&gt; Staff: Bye-bye.

178
00:25:57,954 --> 00:26:02,966
&gt;&gt; Staff: Ayame-chan, you should say bye-bye too. Where's your hand?

179
00:26:07,293 --> 00:26:16,464
After closing, they clean the cafe, arrange supplies, check the cats' health, and so on.

180
00:26:21,911 --> 00:26:26,250
&gt;&gt; Staff: Aren't you going to run away? Good girl.

181
00:26:33,293 --> 00:26:39,836
When the staff handles them, they all become like babies and it's really cute...👶

182
00:26:40,282 --> 00:26:43,074
&gt;&gt; Staff: I'm leaving!

183
00:26:44,756 --> 00:26:48,752
Take care on your way home.

184
00:26:52,501 --> 00:26:55,868
&gt;&gt; Staff: Hey, Kanro.

185
00:26:56,590 --> 00:26:59,418
&gt;&gt; Staff: It's time to go home.

186
00:27:03,093 --> 00:27:07,832
&gt;&gt; Staff: He is big and heavy.

187
00:27:16,672 --> 00:27:19,752
&gt;&gt; Staff: He's angry.

188
00:27:26,959 --> 00:27:32,954
Some cats don't want to go home so much that they play hide and seek with the staff.

189
00:27:59,663 --> 00:28:02,347
&gt;&gt; Staff: Gotcha!

190
00:28:03,554 --> 00:28:06,202
&gt;&gt; Staff: You ran quite a bit, didn't you?

191
00:28:11,179 --> 00:28:17,029
It was really a fun day. Thank you for watching!

